invariant: INV-17
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: ch_p256_key_from_pem returns with the decoded key DER on its own
  stack, and that DER holds the scalar whole. test_key_wipes searches the
  stack below the call and finds it.

--- old
    ct_wipe(der, sizeof der);
    ct_wipe(scalar, sizeof scalar);
--- new
    ct_wipe(scalar, sizeof scalar);
